        "content": "WF3: Automated Climate Control\nPurpose: Ensures the apartment is warm upon arrival and saves energy when empty.\nTriggers: Runs hourly in the background.\nActions:\n\nSyncs with Google Calendar to find today's check-ins and check-outs.\n\nSends a command to the Tuya API to turn the heater ON at 1:00 PM (2 hours before the 3:00 PM check-in).\n\nSends a command to turn the heater OFF at 10:00 AM on checkout day.",
